## intro
Tonight is the Thanksgiving party.
Difficulty: Normal.
The case: the lights went out, and the robot DJ was found in pieces in the Menagerie Yard.
Inspect the remains in the Menagerie Yard for the damage. The power failed when it happened: inspect breaker in the Robot Charging Bay. The house is still dark for you; reset breaker there brings the lights back.
Twelve people were at the party: Yamcha, Master Roshi, Yajirobe, Mai, Mr. Satan, Tien, Gohan, Videl, Krillin, Puar, Dende and Mr. Popo.
