## partylog
The stand-ins' party log: by eleven, the alarm had already gone up in the Menagerie Yard.
## weapon
Shoved out of sight: the Lights Out Capsule, still warm. Dr. Briefs keeps it in the Study, so whoever used it was in there earlier in the night.
## breaker
The breaker's outage log: the lights failed between ten and eleven.
## evidence
You find deep footprints pressed into the carpet pile. (evidence #1)
You find a trail of light, quick footprints through spilled punch. (evidence #2)
You find an untouched slice of cake, the fork never lifted. (evidence #3)
You find a single dark hair caught on a splinter. (evidence #4)
You find a fork with a smear of birthday frosting. (evidence #5)
You find fresh scorch marks, the wallpaper still smoking. (evidence #6)
## plate
Mrs. Briefs' stand-in checks her list: Gohan refused the cake.
## analyze
The analyzer hums over evidence #2: PLANTED. Someone put that there to frame somebody.
